{"3708110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "That Friday again", "steam_appid": 3708110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/24dbd761dea3c7fedd358376ce51fcc1.avif?t=1783885728\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in Medieval Europe. The game is completely historically not accurate. But you will have fun playing it, and that's what matters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/34722a16eea306fa7f36835707aaa8ed.avif?t=1783885728\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings a new choice. Lie, kill, help, poison. What will you do today? The game has many different endings. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/1022e467da0808f1a91d35456f4969b0.avif?t=1783885728\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the curse, you will need to complete the characters' missions: sometimes it will be to accumulate money, sometimes to help with something, and sometimes to sacrifice all the townspeople. For the glory of the gods, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take part in traditional medieval activities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning market!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poisoning the prince!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrificing townspeople to the glory of the gods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/24dbd761dea3c7fedd358376ce51fcc1.avif?t=1783885728\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in Medieval Europe. The game is completely historically not accurate. But you will have fun playing it, and that's what matters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/34722a16eea306fa7f36835707aaa8ed.avif?t=1783885728\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings a new choice. Lie, kill, help, poison. What will you do today? The game has many different endings. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/extras/1022e467da0808f1a91d35456f4969b0.avif?t=1783885728\" width=1438 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the curse, you will need to complete the characters' missions: sometimes it will be to accumulate money, sometimes to help with something, and sometimes to sacrifice all the townspeople. For the glory of the gods, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take part in traditional medieval activities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning market!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poisoning the prince!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrificing townspeople to the glory of the gods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more...</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Medieval Europe. With dark humor, pagan gods, and endless Fridays. You are a former king. Having quarreled with the gods, you lost everything and are stuck in a curse. From now on, you are forced to live the same day forever. Everything depends on your actions. Can you break the curse?", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/274d4ef436ed280da61245a4fb072fb331e897f7/header.jpg?t=1783885728", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/afc62fc19fec3ad80c062c5a9d43316997c32526/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783885728", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708110/afc62fc19fec3ad80c062c5a9d43316997c32526/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783885728", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8GHz Dual-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  OS X 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8GHz Dual-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Слобідський вітер"], "publishers": ["Слобідський вітер"], "demos": [{"appid": 4285240, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap